leged user can force this block to render inside a real checkout-step context. The step CPT is REST-exposed to users with `edit_posts`, but step creation is disabled and capability resolution falls back to default post caps (`modules/flow/classes/class-cartflows-step-post-type.php:194`, `modules/flow/classes/class-cartflows-step-post-type.php:196`). Conclusion: the source-to-sink path is real, but exploitability remains uncertain until the reachable editor/render context is verified.",
